   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Backend needed (ai-service, read-only, same 404 rule as the content view, FR-25):  GET .../versions/{id}/chunks\nreturns family + signals, the rules applied, and per chunk: kind, sectionPath, charStart/charEnd, page, tokenCount.\nThe page preview is the canonical Markdown slice from page_index, not a PDF bitmap: chunks carry character offsets, no bounding boxes.",
   "originalText": "Backend needed (ai-service, read-only, same 404 rule as the content view, FR-25):  GET .../versions/{id}/chunks\nreturns family + signals, the rules applied, and per chunk: kind, sectionPath, charStart/charEnd, page, tokenCount.\nThe page preview is the canonical Markdown slice from page_index, not a PDF bitmap: chunks carry character offsets, no bounding boxes.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "need",
